{604}{A bit of a recluse, he is. No one gets in to see him, from what I have heard. If you want a good laugh, though, look up old Cedric Appleby, his chief competitor. He lives at 1 Low Dervish way, on the corner of Dervish and Lion's Head Circle, I believe.}{A bit of a recluse, he is. No one gets in to see him, from what I have heard. If you want a good laugh, though, look up old Cedric Appleby, his chief competitor. He lives at 1 Low Dervish way, on the corner of Dervish and Lion's Head Circle, I believe.}{}{}{}{ru2198}
