{614}{He hates old Gilbert, he does. Sends him into a complete frenzy if you mention Bates' name to him. He's always trying to discredit Bates somehow or other.}{He hates old Gilbert, he does. Sends him into a complete frenzy if you mention Bates' name to him. He's always trying to discredit Bates somehow or other.}{}{}{}{}
