{622}{Jealousy. Bates is a genius, and Appleby couldn't make a decent steam engine to save his life.}{Jealousy. Bates is a genius, and Appleby couldn't make a decent steam engine to save his life.}{}{}{}{}
{623}{I see. Thank you for your time.}{}{5}{}{82}{}
